{% decision_card number="ADR-0012" status="approved" %}
One decision. Status reviewed 2026-07-27.
{% /decision_card %}

## Context

Models may organize evidence but do not own legal, financial, production, or business authority.

## Decision drivers

- Accountability
- Safety
- Professional authority
- Client control

## Options considered

- Autonomous approval
- Approval only at release
- Risk-specific gates throughout

## Decision

Pause material architecture, spending, legal/privacy, production, merge, deployment, and release until an authorized human records a scoped decision.

## Positive consequences

- Authority stays accountable
- Stops irreversible ambiguity

## Negative consequences

- Human availability can delay work

## Risks

- A vague approval may be over-applied

## Follow-up work

- Record scope, person, time, and rationale
- Expire approvals when scope changes

## Supersedes or superseded by

New decision; superseded by: none.

